FILE>>>|sc_alias
# `.sc_alias` stand for  Short Cut Alias
# More information https://github.com/EloiStree/PlayTo_HordesIO/tree/main
# Find and replace a text in all shortcut of the interpreter by a new text
# short  cut alias♦text to replace with ♦ Hint information for debugging

forward♦1038♦W or Arrow Forward Move character forward
left♦1065♦A Translate to left side
back♦1040♦S or Arrow Backward Move backward
right♦1068♦D  Translate to the right side
turn_left♦1037♦ Arrow Left to turn on the left side
turn_right♦1039♦ Arrow right to turn on the right side
map♦1077♦M to toggle the map UI
skills♦1075♦K To toggle the Skill UI with the list of power
character♦1067♦C To toggle the character sheet with all the stats
inventory♦1073♦B To toggle display the inventory and money count in your bag
clan♦1071♦G To toggle display the clan information if you a have one
pvp♦1086♦V  To toggle your player versus player information
party♦1080♦P  To toggle  display the party in the server to join
social♦1073♦I  To toggle Your friend information 
target_next_enemy♦1009♦ Tab to target the next enemy in the list
target_next_friendly♦1088♦ X the next friendly target
untarget♦1027♦Escape to untarget an friendly or enemy
skillbar1♦1049♦1 To trigger the power 1
skillbar2♦1050♦2 To trigger the power 2
skillbar3♦1051♦3 To trigger the power 3
skillbar4♦1052♦4 To trigger the power 4
skillbar5♦1053♦5 To trigger the power 5
skillbar6♦1054♦6 To trigger the power 6
skillbar7♦1055♦7 To trigger the power 7
skillbar8♦1056♦8 To trigger the power 8
skillbar9♦10457♦9 To trigger the power 9
skillbar10♦1048♦0 To trigger the power 10
skillbar11♦♦None To trigger the power 11 
skillbar12♦♦None To trigger the power 12
skillbar13♦♦None To trigger the power 13
skillbar14♦♦None To trigger the power 14
skillbar15♦♦None To trigger the power 15
skillbar16♦♦None To trigger the power 16

show_ground♦1016♦None Shift To display object on the  ground
jump♦1032♦Space to jump with the champion

